sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant svc as LinkCheckService
    participant rep as reputationclient
    participant store as linkstore (PostgreSQL)
    participant worker as taskbox.Worker
    participant h as api/tasks handler

    Client->>svc: Check("https://bad.example.com/login")
    activate svc
    svc->>rep: CheckReputation (cache miss)
    rep-->>svc: flagged
    svc->>store: Record(entry, recheck-flagged-link task)
    activate store
    Note over store: one pgx.Tx: INSERT link_checks,<br/>lock taskbox_group, INSERT taskbox_task
    store-->>svc: committed
    deactivate store
    svc-->>Client: flagged
    deactivate svc

    Note over worker: RECHECK_AFTER later
    worker->>store: claim (SKIP LOCKED, head of group)
    activate worker
    worker->>h: delivery {url}
    activate h
    h->>svc: Recheck(url)
    svc->>rep: CheckReputation
    rep-->>svc: Unavailable
    svc-->>h: ErrUnavailable
    h-->>worker: 503
    deactivate h
    worker->>store: pending, run_at = now + backoff (fenced by attempt)
    deactivate worker

    worker->>store: claim again after backoff
    activate worker
    worker->>h: delivery {url}
    activate h
    h->>svc: Recheck(url)
    svc->>rep: CheckReputation
    rep-->>svc: clean
    svc->>store: Record(fresh entry)
    h-->>worker: 200
    deactivate h
    worker->>store: done
    deactivate worker
